# Tools

This is the blank-workspace TOOLS.md scaffold included in every openclaw image defaults bundle.
It documents no tools. Specialised templates override this file in full to describe the tools
their agent is expected to call.

## Image provenance

- Image version: `{{ image_version }}`
- Upstream OpenClaw: `{{ upstream_version }}`
- Built: `{{ build_date }}`

## Default tooling

No tools are configured at the image defaults level. The gateway is reachable on its configured
port, and any other tool integration (dprox, channels, model providers) is introduced by the
specialised template or instance compile step.

